# kin/child/neck/torc: a brass torc round the neck, open at the throat (metal2)
# (KIN-CHILD, P2b wave 2; the child, STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role neck torc
layer neck
anchor neck
keys rest

view D key rest origin 3 0
|NOP.PON

view U key rest origin 3 0
|NOOPPON

view R key rest origin 2 0
|NOPPO

view L key rest origin 2 0
|NPPOO
